---
kind: scene
id: spine.elite.morwen
title: The Elite Four — Morwen
on: challenge
target: arena.shadeChamber
once: false
when: "@badgeCount >= 8 && holds(defeated(tarrok)) && !holds(defeated(morwen))"
---

## The chamber

::bg{location="shadeChamber" time="day"}
::auto{character="morwen" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@morwen: I am Morwen. I was battling when the professor was a boy. Do you know what my monsters see in you?
::music{action="change" mood="battle" volume="up"}
::battle{foe="morwen" kind="elite" resultKey="fight"}
<match on="scene.battle.fight.won">
  <when is="true">
    @morwen: Well. The old woman loses one. Go on, child. The Dragon is waiting.
    ::assert{defeated(morwen)}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @morwen: They saw a child who was not ready. Rest.
    // the streak breaks: the whole Four must be beaten again
    ::retract{defeated(frostine)}
    ::retract{defeated(tarrok)}
    ::retract{defeated(morwen)}
    ::retract{defeated(drakon)}
  </otherwise>
</match>
